---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About EU DPP Provider | Enterprise Compliance & Sovereign Data Vault"
  description="Learn about EU DPP Provider: Our mission, 3-layer architecture, 10-year data hosting SLA, and cross-border battery compliance engineering."
>

  <!-- ==================== HERO SECTION (Sovereign Navy) ==================== -->
  <section class="hero-gradient text-white pt-24 pb-20 border-b border-navy-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-cyan-200 bg-white/[0.06] border border-white/[0.14] mb-6">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
          <span>About EU DPP Provider · Enterprise Profile</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.06] text-white">
          Turning Regulatory Complexity into <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <em class="not-italic text-cyan-500">Audit-Ready Data Chains</em>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-[19px] leading-relaxed text-white/75 max-w-3xl font-normal">
          EU DPP Provider is a specialized compliance technology vendor and data vault operator. We bridge global battery manufacturers, European automotive OEMs, and EU market surveillance authorities through standardized, privacy-preserving Digital Product Passports.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center">
          <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="btn-primary-cyan inline-flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>Contact Business Desk: info@eudppprovider.com</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-ghost-hero inline-flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>Book a Technical Briefing</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== CORE PHILOSOPHY ==================== -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-2">01 · Our Core Principles</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
          Built on Four Engineering Axioms
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Why leading battery cell makers, pack assemblers, and BESS integrators choose our compliance architecture.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        
        <div class="panel-card p-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-navy-800 text-cyan-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-5">
            01
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Connect, Don't Replace</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
            We operate as a read-only middleware layer between ERP, MES, PLM, and BMS. We do not replace your core systems or disrupt factory execution.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-card p-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-navy-800 text-green-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-5">
            02
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Dual-System Reuse</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
            Collect once, deploy twice. Our unified data model aligns EU 70+ mandatory fields with China 96-item national traceability code (24-digit ID).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-card p-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-navy-800 text-cyan-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-5">
            03
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Zero-Knowledge Shield</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
            Domestic computation with whitelist filtering. Only required regulatory fields cross borders, safeguarding proprietary chemistry and BOM pricing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-card p-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-navy-800 text-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-5">
            04
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">10-Year Lifecycle SLA</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
            A battery passport must survive until recycling. We guarantee 10-year hosting, 99.9% uptime, and mandatory EU regulatory adaptations within 30 days.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== 3-LAYER ARCHITECTURE ==================== -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow mb-2">02 · Technical Foundation</div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
            A Robust Three-Tier Data Chain
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
            The engineering effort of a battery passport lies 80% in upstream supply chain ingestion. Our layered architecture decouples industrial connectivity from regulatory publication.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">
                <span>L3 · Application & Publication Layer</span>
                <span class="text-cyan-600 font-mono text-xs">Public / Notified Body / Recycler</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
                Generates 4-tier role-based QR portals, eIDAS 2.0 digital signatures, and automated EU Registry UPI synchronization.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">
                <span>L2 · Governance & Calculation Layer</span>
                <span class="text-green-700 font-mono text-xs">7 Data Domains Model</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
                Standardized mapping rules, PEFCR carbon footprint modeling, OECD due diligence verification, and quality audit scoring.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">
                <span>L1 · Read-Only Connection Layer</span>
                <span class="text-navy-900 font-mono text-xs">ERP / MES / PLM / BMS</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
                Non-intrusive connectors, incremental data sync, supplier portal uploads, and real-time anomaly alerts.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-card p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-cyan-50/30 border-cyan-200/80">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Global Operations & Hubs</h3>
          
          <div class="space-y-6 text-sm">
            <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
              <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>🇪🇺 Frankfurt & Munich, Germany</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-600">EU Sovereign Vault</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
                Hosting nodes in ISO 27001 data centers, eIDAS QTSP certificate handling, and direct EU Commission Registry interface.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
              <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>🇨🇳 Shanghai & Shenzhen, China</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-600">Supply Chain Integration</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">
                Factory MES/laser serialization engineers, upstream supplier data collection, and domestic border security governance.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Official Business Inquiries</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">
                Direct all procurement, technical consultation, and partnership requests to our dedicated desk:
              </p>
              <div class="mt-2 p-3 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-mono font-bold text-navy-900 text-xs">info@eudppprovider.com</span>
                <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-600 hover:text-cyan-700">Send Email →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== ECOSYSTEM PARTNERS ==================== -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-2">03 · Verified Ecosystem</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
          Standards & Authorized Interoperability
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          We integrate directly with Europe’s leading trust service providers, notified certification bodies, and industrial automotive networks.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="panel-card p-6 text-center">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-cyan-600 uppercase mb-1">eIDAS 2.0 / QTSP</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">DigiCert EU / QSeal & QES</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">PAdES Baseline Qualified Seals</div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-card p-6 text-center">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-green-700 uppercase mb-1">Audit & Certification</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">EU Notified Bodies (NB)</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">TÜV / SGS / DEKRA Direct Bridge</div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-card p-6 text-center">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-cyan-600 uppercase mb-1">Automotive Data Space</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Catena-X Aligned</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">Gaia-X & EDC Protocol Ready</div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-card p-6 text-center">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase mb-1">Standard Consortium</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Battery Pass & Cirpass</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">Standardized JSON-LD Ontologies</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== FINAL CTA BANNER ==================== -->
  <section class="py-20 hero-gradient text-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
        Start with a Single Model. Prove Compliance in 6 Weeks.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-white/75 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Speak directly with our solutions architects to begin your field gap assessment.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="btn-primary-cyan">
          Contact: info@eudppprovider.com
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
